  "notes": "USAGE:\nCommonly used in business, academic, and technical contexts. The pattern {互|たが}いに{補完|ほかん}する (to complement each other) is especially frequent. Also appears in computing contexts such as {自動|じどう}{補完|ほかん} (autocomplete).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {補足|ほそく}: supplementary explanation, additional note\n- {補充|ほじゅう}: replenishment, filling a vacancy\n- {補填|ほてん}: compensation, making up a deficit\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {互|たが}いに{補完|ほかん}する: to complement each other\n- {補完|ほかん}{関係|かんけい}: complementary relationship\n- {補完|ほかん}{的|てき}: complementary\n- {自動|じどう}{補完|ほかん}: autocomplete",
